This work is distributed under the LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL),
version 1.3c or, at your option, any later version.

The latest version of the license is available at
https://www.latex-project.org/lppl.txt

The work has LPPL maintenance status "maintained". The Current Maintainer is
Andreas Willibald Weber.

The work consists of the source files kanban-board.dtx,
kanban-board-registry.dtx, kanban-board-dates.dtx,
kanban-board-config.dtx, kanban-board-render.dtx,
kanban-board-lifecycle.dtx, and kanban-board.ins. It also includes
build.lua, README.md, CHANGELOG.md, DEPENDS.txt, and LICENSE, the example
files kanban-board-example.tex, kanban-board-modes-example.tex,
kanban-board-deadlines-example.tex, kanban-board-date-formats-example.tex,
kanban-board-palette-example.tex, kanban-board-columnsep-example.tex,
kanban-board-break-example.tex, and kanban-board-landscape-example.tex,
the files in the testfiles directory, and the derived files
kanban-board.sty and kanban-board.pdf.
